-      "lmx_notes_en": "The listing contains the bracket body from src/generic_wrappers.lmx. Resource and actuals travel in a vector of typed value records, not a reinterpreted dense int array. Generic apply uses ordinary argument admission and returns a record carrying the exact result type. The direct record API reports previously unknown failures as FxCallFailure with the original name and payload. Generated typed callables instead retain their declared failures through the explicit raise bridge.",
