+## Perl
+
+[Исходник](source/perl/P11.pl).
+
+```perl
+use strict;
+use warnings;
+sub example {
+    my ($items) = @_;
+    my (%groups, @order);
+    for my $event (@$items) {
+        my $key = $event->{kind};
+        push @order, $key unless exists $groups{$key};
+        push @{$groups{$key}}, $event;
+    }
+    return [map { [0 + $_, $groups{$_}] } @order];
+}
